

**25.4.36**: \(\int_{\circ}^{1}\frac{f(x)}{\sqrt{1-x}}\,dx{=}{\sum\limits_{i =1}^{n}w_{i}f(x_{i})+R_{n}}\)

Related orthogonal polynomials:

\[P_{2n}(\sqrt{1-x}),P_{2n}(1)=1\]

**Abscissas:** \(x_{i}{\equiv}1-{\xi}_{i}^{2}\) **where** \(\xi_{i}\) **is the** \(i^{\rm th}\) **positive zero of** \(P_{2n}(x)\)**. Weights:** \(w_{i}{=}2w_{i}{}^{(2n)},w_{i}{}^{(2n)}\) **are the Gaussian weights of order** \(2n\)**. Remainder:**

\[R_{n}{=}\frac{2^{4n+1}}{4n+1}\frac{[(2n)!]^{n}}{[(4n)!]^{n}}f^{(2n)}(\xi)\quad(0 {<}{\xi}{<}1)\]

**25.4.37**: \(\int_{*}^{\flat}\frac{f(y)}{\sqrt{b-y}}dy{=}\sqrt{b-a}\,{\sum\limits_{i =1}^{n}w_{i}f(y_{i})+R_{n}}\)

\[y_{i}{=}a{+}(b{-}a)x_{i}\]

**Related orthogonal polynomials:**

\[P_{2n}(\sqrt{1-x}),P_{2n}(1)=1\]

**Abscissas:**

\[x_{i}{=}1-{\xi}_{i}^{2}\]

**where** \(\xi_{i}\) **is the** \(i^{\rm th}\) **positive zero of** \(P_{2n}(x)\)**. Weights:** \(w_{i}{=}2w_{i}{}^{(2n)},w_{i}{}^{(2n)}\) **are the Gaussian weights of order** \(2n\)**.**

**25.4.38**: \(\int_{-1}^{+1}\frac{f(x)}{\sqrt{1-x}}\,dx{=}{\sum\limits_{i =1}^{n}w_{i}f(x_{i})+R_{n}}\)

