\[T_{n}(x),T_{n}(1)=\frac{1}{2^{8-1}}\]

**Abscissas:**

\[x_{i}{=}\cos\frac{(2i{-}1)\pi}{2n}\]

**Weights:**

\[w_{i}{=}\frac{\pi}{n}\]

**Reaninder:**

\[R_{*}{=}\frac{\pi}{(2n)\mathbb{D}^{2n-1}}f^{(2n)}(\xi)\quad(-1{<}{\xi}{<}1)\]

**25.4.39**: \(\int_{*}^{\flat}\frac{f(y)dy}{\sqrt{(y-a)}(b-y)}{=}{\sum\limits_{i =1}^{n}w_{i}f(y_{i})+R_{n}}\)

\[y_{i}{=}\frac{b{+}a}{2}{+}\frac{b{-}a}{2}x_{i}\]

